1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
क्या EEG या fMRI experience सीधे पढ़ सकते हैं?

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,800
अभी कोई universal consciousness meter नहीं

3
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:11,700
Report, performance और neural signal अलग हैं

4
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:15,700
Subjective measure: participant का अनुभव

5
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:19,500
Clarity या experience की report

6
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:23,400
Response criterion result बदल सकता है

7
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:27,400
Objective: forced-choice और accuracy

8
00:00:27,400 --> 00:00:31,200
d-prime और reaction time

9
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:35,100
Performance = subjective experience नहीं

10
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:39,100
Masking: visible बनाम masked stimulus

11
00:00:39,100 --> 00:00:43,000
Processing और awareness का dissociation

12
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:46,900
Masking खुद visual processing बदलती है

13
00:00:46,900 --> 00:00:50,800
Chance = awareness की absolute absence नहीं

14
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:54,700
No-report: indirect proxies से inference

15
00:00:54,700 --> 00:00:58,600
Eye movement, pupil, physiology और imaging

16
00:00:58,600 --> 00:01:02,500
Attention और alternative explanations रह सकते हैं

17
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:06,400
Neural correlate = consciousness meter नहीं

18
00:01:06,400 --> 00:01:10,300
Report, performance, masking या proxy?

19
00:01:10,300 --> 00:01:13,920
Educational reel; diagnosis या treatment advice नहीं
